### Coaches Pow-Wow: Ideation

Marisha held a discussion with me about TLA Development Support Strategies (Podcast, Bitesize Videos etc) that had been discussed in the Quality meeting the day before.

I drafted some thoughts and ideas on how each element needs to be treated and the practical elements needed for them to be realised.

I then extended the thinking to Web-based TLA Development App, both my notes and a mock up are attached to these notes:

WEB-BASED APP:

- Support Begginer Teachers to Innovative Practicioners - Reason: New or less experienced teachers can 

access early self-help support, find out about TLA strategies, explore them at greater depth, generate innovative 

approaches to TLA strat. They can access the resources and programs already offered in one place - like the 

Podcasts, Videos, PDFs, Webinars, Research etc. A one-stop-shop to TLA Development.

- Hosting and Organising all Resources - Reason: All videos, documents, podcasts, research, EHCPs, SoL or 

Curriculum knowledge (eg, exam board criteria) could sit on this site for access. This is specifically useful for 

some of the functions later, like idea / resource generation, or support / TLA CPD. TLA Pedagogy can underpin 

this app - Rosenshine, UDL, Quality First Teaching, SOLO Taxonomy, 21CLD and many more. Either find out 

more, or use the knowledge from these resources to drive output from the app

- Idea / Resource Generator - Reason: Imagine covering a lesson with little information or resources. You 

might be able to look up the area, level, and back-filled curriculum overview that the app draws from to produce 

resources or ideas for a starter / ice breaker, or conversation, or questioning strategy, or how to adapt a lesson 

to meet learner needs.

- Smart digital Coaching Programme - Reason: Heuristic Logic - it feels real, with AI inteligence, but it follows 

basic rules and processes. Potentially, this might (IT permission required) be linked to other programs, like 

Hyper, where targets set for departments or staff are traceable in the TLA App. Either way, the Smart Coach can 

generate personalised and tailored CPD pathways. This will enable coaching and mentoring conversations to 

exist at a much higher level ensuring deeper and wider impact. A good way to look at this is enhanced and 

smart filtering systems.

- Measurable and Accountable / Reporting - Reason: Reports can be exported for CPD / Engagement / 

Progress of Departments or People. Exported data can be displayed on a dashboard for macro level overview, 

and filtered for micro-level analysis.

- NB - This app would be significant and would take some time to build. Support and collaboration with other 

teams would be advisable to reach its full potential. This could be developed by either the Digital Team or 

myself, or more realistically, as a collaborative project between us.

- ADVICE - Even though this is the dream, starting early on this project helps ensure it is fully functional, tested, 

and quality assured for full adoption September 2026.

- ADDITIONAL - The app could have a reflection section to help users build on their experiences in the CPD 

sections. A CPD journal if you will. This can be used to support professional development conversations.